  "body": "At now Matrix use JSON format for event serialization, that contain uncompressed plain text messages and not so effective for traffic. Will be good to have alternative protocols for encode events body, like Protobuf, that use much less traffic, here is comparison of different message serialization protocols: https://eng.uber.com/trip-data-squeeze/",
